\f0 \cf0 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 2. The braid principle we agreed on\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 The Elvi/UDF/golf/village material should 
\f1\b not
\f2\b0  become a long self-contained chronicle that rushes through the 23rd and 24th and makes everything else seem to happen afterwards.\
It should be 
\f1\b braided among the more detailed narratives
\f2\b0 .\
Those returns are:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
changes of POV and pace;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
compressed;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
funny;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
there to mark that the external situation has developed since the reader last saw it;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
large enough to have narrative flow;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
small enough that they never become substitute scenes.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 They should 
\f1\b not
\f2\b0  be chopped into tiny timeline-compliance fragments.\
A compressed movement can span hours. Another timed event may occur during it. We only need to avoid contradicting that event.\
That distinction is essential.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

