\f1\b\fs36 5. The style findings that were finally working\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 This was another point we had actually improved before the structural mess.\
From your Scrivener prose, rather than my chat-writing habits:\
Your paragraphs generally 
\f1\b carry a run of related action, observation and consequence
\f2\b0 . They do not fracture every beat into a separate one-line paragraph.\
A paragraph tends to accumulate enough material to establish a physical/social situation, then pivots or lands.\
You enter 
\f1\b sideways
\f2\b0 , through something happening.\
You do not normally start with:\
Here is the situation.\
You let the situation emerge.\
Humour comes from:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
practical consequences;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
institutional behaviour;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
status;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
character;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
specific physical detail;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
absurdities treated as materially real.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The narrator does not stop afterwards to explain why the joke worked.\
We had also explicitly established:\

\f1\b No contrasting-negation scaffolding.
\f2\b0 \
No:\
Not X. Y.\
No:\
This did not prevent\'85\
No weak proposition introduced solely so the next sentence can reverse it.\
State the interesting fact.\
Likewise, no narrator announcement lines such as:\
The vigil grew.\uc0\u8232 The Airborne children began arriving.\u8232 Music moved into the village.\
Enter through the actual manifestation of the development.\
And no generic thematic summations like the appalling unborn-child \'93sat\'94 sentence.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

